      "title": "Video: text to video with sound on LTX 2.5",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Video: text to video with sound on LTX 2.5\n\nMakes a clip of 2 to 5 seconds from a prompt and an optional camera sentence with LTX 2.5, in two stages with a 2 times latent upscale, and makes its sound. A run with sound off drops the audio track. Built from Comfy's template video_ltx2_5_t2v.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ltx-2.5-latent-spatial-upscaler-x2-bf16-1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/latent_upscale_models/ltx-2.5-latent-spatial-upscaler-x2-bf16-1.0.safetensors): LTX 2.5 latent upscaler, 2 times, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.5 22B distilled, bf16, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.5 video VAE, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.5 audio VAE, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-bf16.safetensors): Gemma 4 12B text encoder with the LTX 2.5 projections, bf16, [the licence of the LTX 2.5 repository it sits in](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
